{"about_the_game":"The Kingdom has fallen to the Mad King, who has used forbidden magic to try resuscitate the queen. But the powers of life and death were too big to handle for him, and as a consequence, the King has lost his sanity. Slain hordes of enemies through careful button smashing! Faithful to a brawler, with the additional strategic layer of a roguelite, the destiny of the Kingdom lay upon your shoulders. Upgrade your brotherhood of heroes after each run to unlock combat skills, artifacts and heroes.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">BEAT'EM'UP GAMEPLAY</h2>Drawing inspiration from beloved classics, we've crafted a beat'em'up experience that combines old-school controls and retro feelings with innovative 3D mechanics. Each of the 4 playable characters comes with their signature combat styles, customizable stats that impact gameplay, and detailed backstories to discover. Every hero has committed a sin. They also need redemption.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">ROGUELITE PROGRESSION</h2>Unlock new heroes, attack moves, and artifacts with every run, while venturing forth in the depths of the forbidden cloister, to look for the Mad King so he can be relieved from his madness. Every run is unique, with randomized elements. Only a united brotherhood of heroes can overcome the Mad King: any damage inflicted on him persists in the same run, until all heroes are dead - or the Mad King is defeated. With each new run, all heroes are reborn, but the Mad King is also back to full health.","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2369580?t=1740757381","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2369580/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1740757381","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2369580/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1740757381","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2369580/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1740757381","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"The Kingdom has fallen to the Mad King, who has used forbidden magic to try resuscitate the queen. But the powers of life and death were too big to handle for him, and as a consequence, the King has lost his sanity. Slain hordes of enemies through careful button smashing! Faithful to a brawler, with the additional strategic layer of a roguelite, the destiny of the Kingdom lay upon your shoulders. Upgrade your brotherhood of heroes after each run to unlock combat skills, artifacts and heroes.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">BEAT'EM'UP GAMEPLAY</h2>Drawing inspiration from beloved classics, we've crafted a beat'em'up experience that combines old-school controls and retro feelings with innovative 3D mechanics. Each of the 4 playable characters comes with their signature combat styles, customizable stats that impact gameplay, and detailed backstories to discover. Every hero has committed a sin. They also need redemption.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">ROGUELITE PROGRESSION</h2>Unlock new heroes, attack moves, and artifacts with every run, while venturing forth in the depths of the forbidden cloister, to look for the Mad King so he can be relieved from his madness. Every run is unique, with randomized elements. Only a united brotherhood of heroes can overcome the Mad King: any damage inflicted on him persists in the same run, until all heroes are dead - or the Mad King is defeated. With each new run, all heroes are reborn, but the Mad King is also back to full health.","developers":["SECRET MISSION"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"descriptio